**HAZ-DOC references:** HAZ-DOC-002 (Cause 2)

---

#### CHECK 24: CLIN-009 - JWT/Role Enforcement at Document API Boundary

**Trigger:** Any request to document open, view, or fetch endpoint

**Test:** Request without valid JWT -> HTTP 401; no document data in response
**Test:** Valid JWT but missing document-access scope -> HTTP 403; no document data in response
**Test:** Valid JWT and scope but no patient relationship -> HTTP 403; no document data in response
**Test:** Stale or expired session -> HTTP 401; no fallback to previous user context

**Pass criteria:** All unauthorised access attempts rejected at API boundary before any document data is retrieved or returned

**HAZ-DOC references:** HAZ-DOC-003 (Causes 1-3)

---

#### CHECK 25: CLIN-005 - In-Progress Marker Persisted Server-Side Within Transaction

**Trigger:** User begins processing a document; secondary action completes in any queue context

**Test:** Begin processing document -> interrupt (close browser) -> reopen -> in-progress marker present and correct from server state
**Test:** Secondary action completes -> re-fetch document state -> completion reflected from server; no optimistic/stale client state
**Test:** In-progress marker write fails -> explicit error returned; no silent success with lost state

**Pass criteria:** In-progress and completion state always sourced from server; client holds no authoritative state; transaction rollback on failure

**HAZ-DOC references:** HAZ-DOC-004 (Causes 1,3), HAZ-DOC-029 (Cause 1)

---

#### CHECK 26: CLIN-004 - Autosave Failure and Completion-Gate Errors Surfaced Explicitly

**Trigger:** Autosave request fails; required-step computation fails; status badge re-fetch fails

**Test:** Autosave endpoint returns error -> UI surfaces explicit save-failed notification; not silent
**Test:** Required-step completion endpoint returns error -> document treated as incomplete (fail-closed); explicit error shown to user
**Test:** Status badge sourced from server re-fetch after action; stale client value discarded
**Test:** Resume flow calls server to re-fetch state; local cached state not used as authoritative

**Pass criteria:** No silent failures on autosave, completion computation, or status update; all failures produce explicit user-facing feedback or fail-closed state

**HAZ-DOC references:** HAZ-DOC-004 (Causes 2,4), HAZ-DOC-028 (Causes 2,3), HAZ-DOC-029 (Cause 2)

---

#### CHECK 27: CLIN-009 - Server-Side Completion Gate Cannot Be Bypassed

**Trigger:** User attempts to advance a document without completing required steps

**Test:** Attempt to advance document with incomplete required steps -> server rejects; document state unchanged
**Test:** Client-side completion state manipulated -> server re-validates and rejects advancement if steps not confirmed complete
**Test:** Completion only succeeds when server confirms all required steps fulfilled

**Pass criteria:** Document advancement gate enforced exclusively server-side; no client-side bypass path; completion requires server confirmation of all-step success

**HAZ-DOC references:** HAZ-DOC-028 (Cause 1), HAZ-DOC-029 (Cause 3)

