## PxD (Added by V1d)

### User Flow

**Primary Flow — Approach B (Filing Queue — Confirmed):**
1. Practice admin navigates to Documents Manager via sidebar nav
2. **Filing Queue** screen renders as the default landing view; skeleton rows displayed while data loads (`Skeleton.Area` + `role="status"`)
3. Documents appear in table, sorted newest first; count badges update on each `Tabs.Tab`; Unmatched tab badge shows count of unresolved documents
4. Admin scans urgent documents (red arrow, sorted to top) — no document open required
5. Admin clicks a document row (or presses Enter on focused row)
6. Gallery view opens: Document Viewer (left ~60%) + Workflow panel (right ~40%)
7. Patient Match panel active by default; admin confirms or overrides the suggested patient match
8. Admin completes filing fields; optionally completes Code and Tasks secondary panels from the same view
9. Admin clicks "Next document" (only enabled when all required steps complete) — advances to next in queue
10. When queue exhausted: "Next document" absent; returned to queue list with empty-state message

**Unmatched Documents Tab Flow:**
1. Admin clicks the **Unmatched Documents** tab — shows documents where no patient match was determined
2. Admin opens a document from the Unmatched Documents tab
3. Gallery view opens; Patient Match panel shown; admin performs manual patient search
4. Admin confirms a match — document moves out of Unmatched Documents tab and into **Patient Matched Documents** tab
5. Document is now visible in Patient Matched Documents tab (filing workflow continues in Increment 2)

**Alternative Flow — Won’t be filed / Reject:** *(Deferred — Increment 2. See Acceptance Criteria — Deferred to Increment 2.)*

**Exit Types:**
- **Match confirmed:** Patient match step complete → “Next document” advances; document moves to Patient Matched Documents tab
- **Cancel:** “Back to queue” at any point — autosave preserves in-progress state; row shows in-progress badge
- **Queue-Peek Navigate:** Click a different document in the peek sidebar — autosave triggers; current doc retains in-progress state; new doc loads
- **Navigate-away:** Browser/SPA navigation while gallery is open — state autosaved server-side; document marked in-progress
- **Reject (Abandon):** *(Deferred — Increment 2)*

