### Component Specifications

> 🚫 All components use `@emisgroup/ui-*` exclusively. No native HTML interactive elements.

**Document Urgency Arrow (shared — spec here; referenced in all queue REQs):**
- Component: `Icon` from `~icons/ic/outline-arrow-upward`
- Colour: `var(--token-colour-feedback-error-base)` (#DA291C)
- Size: 20px
- Visible: urgent documents only (binary — present or absent)
- ARIA: `aria-label={t('inbox.urgency.urgent')}` on Icon wrapper; non-urgent rows have `aria-label={t('inbox.urgency.routine')}` on a visually hidden span
- Placement: leftmost table cell, vertically centred

**Document Status Badge (shared — spec here; referenced in all queue REQs):**
- Component: `Badge`
- `variant="primary"` for in-progress
- `variant="inactive"` for pending/unactioned
- `variant="disabled"` for completed (greyed out)
- ARIA: `role="status"` (built into `Badge`)

**3-dot Actions Menu (shared — spec here; referenced in all queue REQs):**
- Trigger: `Button variant="mono" size="small" circular ariaLabel={t('inbox.actions.menu', { title })}`
- Icon: `~icons/ic/outline-more-vert` (20px)
- Visibility: `opacity: 0` at rest; `opacity: 1` on `tr:hover` and `tr:focus-within` (CSS)
- Menu: `DropdownMenu` (Radix) wrapping trigger + `DropdownMenu.Content align="end"`
- Items: `DropdownMenu.Item` per action; rendered conditionally by queue context
- Keyboard: Arrow keys navigate; Enter activates; Escape closes; focus returns to trigger on close

**Queue Tab Strip:**
- Container: `Tabs` (Radix) with `activationMode="manual"`
- Tab list: `Tabs.TabList`
- Each tab: `Tabs.Tab value={queueType}` with `Count` badge as child: `<Tabs.Tab>{t('inbox.tab.allInbound')} <Count>{allCount}</Count></Tabs.Tab>`
- Active indicator: built-in Radix/EMIS-X underline (uses `var(--token-colour-brand-primary)`)
- Keyboard: Arrow keys move focus; Enter/Space activates and triggers data fetch
- **Increment 1:** Renders 2 tabs only — `value="unmatched"` (Unmatched Documents) and `value="matched"` (Patient Matched Documents). Additional tabs (filing, coding, tasks, completed, rejected) are deferred to later increments.

**Search Input:**
- Component: `Input clearable aria-label={t('inbox.search.ariaLabel')} placeholder={t('inbox.search.placeholder')}`
- Clear button: built-in (`clearable` prop)
- Debounce: 300ms before filter applied

**Reject Dialogue:** *(Deferred — Increment 2. See Acceptance Criteria — Deferred to Increment 2 and CHECK 7 Deferred.)*
- Component: `Dialog` with `preventBackdropClose`
- `Dialog.Header`: "Reject document" (`t('inbox.reject.heading')`)
