- `Dialog.Footer`: `Button variant="mono"` Cancel + `Button variant="danger" disabled={!reasonSelected}` Confirm
- Focus: moves to reason Select on open; returns to ⋮ trigger on close
- Escape: closes dialogue (cancels, no state change)

**Queue-Peek Sidebar (shared — spec here; referenced in all gallery REQs):**
- Container: `<aside aria-label={t('gallery.peek.region')}>` fixed-width 250px; `overflow-y: auto`; collapsible via toggle
