### Micro-interactions

**Skeleton rows (initial load + tab switch):**
```tsx
<Skeleton.Area role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-label={t('inbox.loading')}>
  {Array.from({ length: 8 }).map((_, i) => (
    <Skeleton.Item key={i} style={{ height: 44, marginBottom: 1 }} />
  ))}
</Skeleton.Area>
```
Shimmer pulse built into `Skeleton.Item`. No additional CSS animation required.

**Row hover reveal:** `transition: opacity 150ms ease-in-out` on ⋮ button. Background `transition: background-color 150ms ease-in-out` on `tr`.

**Notification toasts:**
- Success: `Notification variant="success" duration={5000}` — auto-dismiss
- Error (persistent): `Notification variant="error"` — manual close only (`duration={Infinity}`)

**Tab count update:** Immediate re-render on queue data refresh; no transition (clinical data — avoid distracting motion).

